      "text": "Alma2 wishes that people would hearken to his words, Alma 13:27. O that I were angel and could have wish of my heart, Alma 29:1. I am a man and do sin in my wish, Alma 29:3. if robbers can cut Nephites off from outward privileges, Nephites would yield themselves up according to robbers’ wishes, 3 Ne. 4:16.",
